=== prompt
Parse the strings "12" and "abc" as integers. When parsing fails, use -1 instead. Log the two results, one per line. The program must not fail.
=== expected
12
-1
=== reference
["12" "abc"] = xs
0 >= i
Repeat({
  xs | Take(i) = s
  Maybe({s | ParseInt} {-1} Silent: true) | Log
  Inc(i)
} Times: 2)
